		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Shrine kami, oni-slayers. Guardians of temples and holy gates. Appears as a faintly glowing suit of armor with an ornate longbow.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15 (plate mail), <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 spear +5 (1d6) or 2 longbow (far) +5 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Healing Arrow</strong>. Kami can choose to fire a healing arrow, heals 1d8 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ward</strong>. Kami protects a temple or shrine. Can merge into warded area and observe everything occurring there. Arms and armor dissolve if slain.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
